# The rest of what the C library's headers promise, in SemanticScript: string.h's strtok family and glibc's
# extras, stdlib.h's strtof, rand, and aligned allocation, locale.h, assert.h's __assert_fail, and inttypes.h's
# integer-max functions, as glibc behaves in the C locale.
#
# This module is generated from tools/cextra.dsl by tools/build.py.

cextra is module
cextra purpose "The C library's remaining headers in SemanticScript: string.h's strtok family and glibc's extras, stdlib.h's strtof, rand, and aligned allocation, locale.h, assert.h, and inttypes.h, as glibc behaves in the C locale"
cextra path cextra
cextra imports standard.machine
cextra imports standard.system
cextra imports standard.string
cextra imports standard.math
cextra imports standard.compare
